How to source a tarball
-----------------------
  The initrd folds build/alpine-rootfs (an unmodified Alpine minirootfs
  plus a curated apk set installed by tools/build-alpine-rootfs.sh).
  Nothing in the image is downloaded from a distro that does not publish
  its own license; reproducible build artefacts in /build are kept out of
  version control per the notice in Makefile.

